    "First enable ntfs3g in System Settings. Close files on this volume before continuing. A mounted volume will be unmounted normally; busy volumes will not be forced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在系统设置中开启 ntfs3g，并关闭此卷上正在使用的文件。已挂载的卷会先正常卸载；如果正在被占用，不会强制卸载。"
