    },
    "Loaded from a dev build (DerivedData) — install the release app to /Applications." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从开发构建(DerivedData)加载——请将正式版应用安装到 /Applications。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 15 prefers Apple's NTFS driver. This one-time compatibility command switches only the selected volume to xntfs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 15 优先使用苹果内置的 NTFS 驱动。这个一次性兼容命令只将所选卷切换为 xntfs 挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 15 uses Apple's NTFS driver by default. Mount with xntfs requires a one-time command in Terminal, also for images attached in Disk Utility." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 15 默认使用苹果内置的 NTFS 驱动。使用 xntfs 挂载需要在终端执行一次命令，通过磁盘工具附加的镜像也适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
