      }
    },
    "The system did not return an xntfs mount. Refresh the volume list and check Diagnostics." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统未返回由 xntfs 挂载的卷。请刷新卷列表并查看诊断信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The temporary routing entry is removed after the attempt, including on failure or cancellation. Reconnecting the drive may require running a new command." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂载尝试结束后会清理临时路由项，失败或取消时也会清理。重新连接设备后，可能需要再次生成并执行命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The volume mounted with a different access mode than requested. Check its current status before using it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卷已挂载，但实际读写模式与请求不一致。请先确认卷的当前状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This appends ntfs3g to the enabled-modules list only if it's missing, then restarts fskit_agent. It edits files outside the sandbox, so the app can't run it for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在缺失时把 ntfs3g 追加到已启用模块列表,然后重启 fskit_agent。它会修改沙盒之外的文件,所以应用无法替你执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This image is already mounted. Eject it before changing its access mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此镜像已经挂载。如需更改读写模式，请先推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes only xntfs's inactive compatibility entry. It does not unmount volumes, change extension enablement, or remove other filesystem drivers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只清理 xntfs 已停止使用的兼容项，不会卸载卷、更改扩展启用状态或删除其他文件系统驱动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This volume is already mounted. Eject it before changing its access mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此卷已经挂载。如需更改读写模式，请先推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This volume is mounted with xntfs." : {
